{"seq":3,"slug":"gpu-spatial-acceleration","title":"GPU 空间加速结构：并行硬件重塑碰撞与光线追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/advanced-techniques/gpu-spatial-acceleration","wordCount":1353,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"gpu-空间加速结构-并行硬件重塑碰撞与光线追踪\">GPU 空间加速结构：并行硬件重塑碰撞与光线追踪</h1><p>传统空间加速结构在 CPU 上串行执行，面对数百万三角形的场景时遭遇性能瓶颈。现代 GPU 拥有数千个并行核心，天然适合空间查询的批量并行化。从 NVIDIA Turing 架构（2018）引入专用 RT Core 硬件单元，到实时光线追踪被纳入 DirectX 12 Ultimate 标准，GPU 空间加速结构正在重塑实时渲染和物理模拟的可能性边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>LBVH（Linear BVH）</strong>：Morton Code 将 3D 局部性编码为 1D 键，GPU Radix Sort + 并行建树，3ms 构建 1M 三角形</li>\n<li><strong>RT Core</strong>：NVIDIA Turing 起的专用硬件 BVH 遍历单元，光线追踪吞吐量提升 5-10 倍</li>\n<li><strong>TLAS + BLAS 两级</strong>：顶层存实例变换（每帧更新），底层存三角形 BVH（静态或 refit），多实例共享 BLAS</li>\n<li><strong>Compute Shader 宽相</strong>：无需 DXR，通用 GPU 线程并行执行 BVH 遍历，10 万刚体宽相 ~2ms</li>\n<li><strong>Warp Divergence</strong>：GPU 线程束中各线程遍历不同 BVH 路径导致执行效率下降，用宽 BVH（BVH8）和 Stackless 遍历缓解</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"gpu-并行-bvh-构建\">GPU 并行 BVH 构建</h2><p>CPU 端 BVH 构建每帧重建大场景的代价不可接受（数百毫秒），GPU 并行构建将这一代价压缩至毫秒级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"lbvh-线性-bvh-morton-code-方案\">LBVH：线性 BVH（Morton Code 方案）</h3><p>**LBVH（Linear BVH）**是 GPU 并行 BVH 构建的标准方法（Lauterbach et al., 2009），利用 <strong>Morton Code</strong>（Z-order curve）将 3D 空间局部性编码为 1D 排序键，然后并行构建：</p>\n<h4 id=\"步骤-1-计算-morton-code\">步骤 1：计算 Morton Code</h4><p>Morton Code 将 3D 坐标交织成一维整数，保留空间局部性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Morton</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>interleave</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>quantize</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>quantize</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>quantize</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Morton}(x, y, z) = \\text{interleave}(\\text{quantize}(x), \\text{quantize}(y), \\text{quantize}(z))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Morton</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">interleave</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">quantize</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">quantize</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">quantize</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 quantize 将浮点坐标量化为 10-21 位整数。交织操作将三个整数的位按 xyz xyz xyz... 顺序排列：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// 扩展单个 10 位整数为 30 位（每位之间插入 2 个 0）&#10;uint32_t expandBits(uint32_t v) {&#10;    v = (v * 0x00010001u) &amp; 0xFF0000FFu;&#10;    v = (v * 0x00000101u) &amp; 0x0F00F00Fu;&#10;    v = (v * 0x00000011u) &amp; 0xC30C30C3u;&#10;    v = (v * 0x00000005u) &amp; 0x49249249u;&#10;    return v;&#10;}&#10;&#10;uint32_t morton3D(float x, float y, float z) {&#10;    // 将 [0,1] 浮点量化为 [0, 1023] 整数&#10;    uint32_t ix = (uint32_t)std::min(std::max(x * 1024.0f, 0.0f), 1023.0f);&#10;    uint32_t iy = (uint32_t)std::min(std::max(y * 1024.0f, 0.0f), 1023.0f);&#10;    uint32_t iz = (uint32_t)std::min(std::max(z * 1024.0f, 0.0f), 1023.0f);&#10;    return (expandBits(ix) &lt;&lt; 2) | (expandBits(iy) &lt;&lt; 1) | expandBits(iz);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 扩展单个 10 位整数为 30 位（每位之间插入 2 个 0）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> expandBits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00010001</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FF0000FF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00000101</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0F00F00F</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00000011</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">C30C30C3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">00000005</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">49249249</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> morton3D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> z</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 将 [0,1] 浮点量化为 [0, 1023] 整数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ix </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1023.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> iy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1023.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> iz </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1024.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1023.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">expandBits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ix) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">expandBits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(iy) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> expandBits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(iz);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"步骤-2-gpu-radix-sort\">步骤 2：GPU Radix Sort</h4><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个对象的 Morton Code 在 GPU 上做 <strong>Radix Sort</strong>，时间复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，GPU 端实际吞吐远高于 CPU 端 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的比较排序。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;$n$ 个对象\\n计算 Morton Code&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;GPU Radix Sort\\n按 Morton Code 排序\\nO(n)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;自上而下并行建树\\n每个内部节点一个 GPU 线程&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;后序遍历\\n计算 AABB\\n每个节点一个 GPU 线程&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;完成 BVH\\n毫秒级&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"$n$ 个对象\\n计算 Morton Code\"] --&gt; B[\"GPU Radix Sort\\n按 Morton Code 排序\\nO(n)\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"自上而下并行建树\\n每个内部节点一个 GPU 线程\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"后序遍历\\n计算 AABB\\n每个节点一个 GPU 线程\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"完成 BVH\\n毫秒级\"]</pre><h4 id=\"步骤-3-并行建树-karras-2012\">步骤 3：并行建树（Karras 2012）</h4><p>利用 Morton Code 排序后的对象，可以通过分析**相邻前缀的最长公共前缀（LCP）**确定每个内部节点的覆盖范围，从而让每个内部节点独立并行构建，无需串行递归。</p>\n<h3 id=\"gpu-bvh-构建性能\">GPU BVH 构建性能</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 1M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 三角形构建时间</th>\n<th>质量（SAH 代价相对最优）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU SAH Top-Down</td>\n<td>800ms</td>\n<td>100%（最优）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 中位数 Top-Down</td>\n<td>150ms</td>\n<td>130%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU LBVH（Morton）</td>\n<td><strong>3ms</strong></td>\n<td>140-160%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU HLBVH（混合）</td>\n<td><strong>8ms</strong></td>\n<td>110-120%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>**HLBVH（Hierarchical LBVH）**在上层使用 Morton Code 快速并行构建，下层对小子树用 SAH 优化，兼顾速度与质量。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rt-core-专用硬件-bvh-遍历单元\">RT Core：专用硬件 BVH 遍历单元</h2><p>NVIDIA Turing（RTX 20 系）及后续架构引入了专用的 <strong>RT Core</strong> 硬件单元，负责加速 BVH 遍历和光线-三角形求交两个操作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;Shader 发射光线\\nTraceRay()&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;RT Core\\n硬件 BVH 遍历&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{叶节点相交?}&#10;    C --&gt; |否| B&#10;    C --&gt; |是| D[&quot;RT Core\\n硬件光线-三角形求交&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{命中?}&#10;    E --&gt; |否| B&#10;    E --&gt; |是| F[&quot;触发 Closest Hit Shader\\n返回 Shader&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"Shader 发射光线\\nTraceRay()\"] --&gt; B[\"RT Core\\n硬件 BVH 遍历\"]\n    B --&gt; C{叶节点相交?}\n    C --&gt; |否| B\n    C --&gt; |是| D[\"RT Core\\n硬件光线-三角形求交\"]\n    D --&gt; E{命中?}\n    E --&gt; |否| B\n    E --&gt; |是| F[\"触发 Closest Hit Shader\\n返回 Shader\"]</pre><p>RT Core 在每个时钟周期内完成的 BVH 盒子测试和三角形测试次数远高于通用着色器核心，使实时光线追踪每帧射线数量提升 5-10 倍。</p>\n<h3 id=\"directx-12-dxr-api-使用\">DirectX 12 DXR API 使用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// HLSL shader 中的光线追踪（DXR）&#10;[shader(&quot;raygeneration&quot;)]&#10;void RayGenShader() {&#10;    uint2 launchIndex = DispatchRaysIndex().xy;&#10;&#10;    // 构造光线&#10;    RayDesc ray;&#10;    ray.Origin    = cameraPos;&#10;    ray.Direction = computeRayDirection(launchIndex);&#10;    ray.TMin = 0.001f;&#10;    ray.TMax = 10000.0f;&#10;&#10;    // 发射光线（硬件 BVH 遍历）&#10;    RayPayload payload = { float4(0, 0, 0, 0) };&#10;    TraceRay(SceneBVH,           // TLAS（顶层加速结构）&#10;             RAY_FLAG_NONE,&#10;             0xFF,               // 实例 mask&#10;             0, 1, 0,            // Shader 表偏移&#10;             ray, payload);&#10;&#10;    RenderTarget[launchIndex] = payload.color;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// HLSL shader 中的光线追踪（DXR）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"raygeneration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">void RayGenShader() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    uint2 launchIndex </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DispatchRaysIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().xy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 构造光线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RayDesc ray;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ray.Origin    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cameraPos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ray.Direction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeRayDirection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(launchIndex);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ray.TMin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.001</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ray.TMax </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 发射光线（硬件 BVH 遍历）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RayPayload payload </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">float4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    TraceRay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(SceneBVH,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           // TLAS（顶层加速结构）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">             RAY_FLAG_NONE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               // 实例 mask</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">             0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // Shader 表偏移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">             ray, payload);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RenderTarget[launchIndex] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payload.color;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"两级-bvh-架构-tlas-blas\">两级 BVH 架构（TLAS + BLAS）</h2><p>DirectX 12 DXR 和 Vulkan RT 将场景 BVH 分为两层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>顶层（Top Level）</td>\n<td>TLAS</td>\n<td>场景中所有实例的 AABB + 变换矩阵</td>\n<td>每帧（动态对象更新）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底层（Bottom Level）</td>\n<td>BLAS</td>\n<td>单个网格的三角形 BVH</td>\n<td>静态：永不更新；蒙皮：每帧 refit</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    TLAS[&quot;TLAS\\n实例级 BVH\\n存储: (BLAS 引用, 变换矩阵, 实例ID)&quot;] --&gt; BLAS_A[&quot;BLAS A\\n静态建筑网格\\n三角形级 BVH\\n永不更新&quot;]&#10;    TLAS --&gt; BLAS_B[&quot;BLAS B\\n角色骨骼网格\\n每帧 refit(顶点更新)&quot;]&#10;    TLAS --&gt; BLAS_C[&quot;BLAS C\\n粒子/植被\\n每帧重建(程序化)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    Ray[&quot;光线&quot;] --&gt; TLAS\">graph TB\n    TLAS[\"TLAS\\n实例级 BVH\\n存储: (BLAS 引用, 变换矩阵, 实例ID)\"] --&gt; BLAS_A[\"BLAS A\\n静态建筑网格\\n三角形级 BVH\\n永不更新\"]\n    TLAS --&gt; BLAS_B[\"BLAS B\\n角色骨骼网格\\n每帧 refit(顶点更新)\"]\n    TLAS --&gt; BLAS_C[\"BLAS C\\n粒子/植被\\n每帧重建(程序化)\"]\n\n    Ray[\"光线\"] --&gt; TLAS</pre><p><strong>优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>静态网格的 BLAS 只构建一次，质量最高</li>\n<li>多个实例（树木、石头）共享同一 BLAS，只在 TLAS 中复制变换矩阵</li>\n<li>TLAS 每帧更新代价低（只更新实例变换，不重建三角形 BVH）</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"gpu-compute-shader-空间查询\">GPU Compute Shader 空间查询</h2><p>不依赖 DXR/RT Core，也可以用通用 <strong>Compute Shader</strong> 并行执行空间查询：</p>\n<h3 id=\"gpu-宽相碰撞检测\">GPU 宽相碰撞检测</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"// Compute Shader：并行执行 N 个对象与 BVH 的相交测试&#10;layout(local_size_x = 256) in;&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;    uint objId = gl_GlobalInvocationID.x;&#10;    if (objId &gt;= objectCount) return;&#10;&#10;    AABB objAABB = objectAABBs[objId];&#10;    uint stackTop = 0;&#10;    uint stack[64];&#10;    stack[stackTop++] = 0;  // 根节点&#10;&#10;    while (stackTop &gt; 0) {&#10;        uint nodeId = stack[--stackTop];&#10;        BVHNode node = bvhNodes[nodeId];&#10;&#10;        if (!aabbIntersect(objAABB, node.aabb)) continue;&#10;&#10;        if (node.isLeaf) {&#10;            // 记录碰撞对&#10;            uint slot = atomicAdd(collisionPairCount, 1);&#10;            if (slot &lt; MAX_COLLISION_PAIRS) {&#10;                collisionPairs[slot] = uvec2(objId, node.objId);&#10;            }&#10;        } else {&#10;            stack[stackTop++] = node.leftChild;&#10;            stack[stackTop++] = node.rightChild;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Compute Shader：并行执行 N 个对象与 BVH 的相交测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(local_size_x = 256) in;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint objId = gl_GlobalInvocationID.x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (objId >= objectCount) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    AABB objAABB = objectAABBs[objId];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint stackTop = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    uint stack[64];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    stack[stackTop++] = 0;  // 根节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while (stackTop > 0) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uint nodeId = stack[--stackTop];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        BVHNode node = bvhNodes[nodeId];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!aabbIntersect(objAABB, node.aabb)) continue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (node.isLeaf) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 记录碰撞对</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            uint slot = atomicAdd(collisionPairCount, 1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (slot &#x3C; MAX_COLLISION_PAIRS) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                collisionPairs[slot] = uvec2(objId, node.objId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            stack[stackTop++] = node.leftChild;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            stack[stackTop++] = node.rightChild;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"gpu-栈遍历的挑战\">GPU 栈遍历的挑战</h3><p>GPU 线程的栈大小有限（通常 64 个节点足够深度 64 的树），且线程束（warp）中的不同线程往往遍历不同的 BVH 路径，导致<strong>线程发散（Warp Divergence）</strong>，降低并行效率。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>宽 BVH（BVH8）</strong>：减少树深，减小栈需求，提高缓存命中率</li>\n<li><strong>Stackless 遍历</strong>：利用 BVH 结构中的 parent 指针，无需栈</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能对比-cpu-vs-gpu-空间查询\">性能对比：CPU vs GPU 空间查询</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>CPU（8 核）</th>\n<th>GPU（RTX 3080）</th>\n<th>提速比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1M 三角形 BVH 构建</td>\n<td>800ms (SAH) / 150ms (中位数)</td>\n<td>3-8ms</td>\n<td>20-100x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100 万条光线追踪</td>\n<td>~5000ms</td>\n<td>~10ms（RT Core）</td>\n<td>~500x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 万刚体宽相检测</td>\n<td>~100ms</td>\n<td>~2ms</td>\n<td>~50x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"适用场景决策\">适用场景决策</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A{是否有 GPU 加速需求?} --&gt; |否| B[CPU BVH\\n成熟稳定\\nPhysX/Jolt]&#10;    A --&gt; |是| C{场景类型}&#10;    C --&gt; |实时光线追踪\\n全局光照\\n反射| D[DXR/Vulkan RT\\nTLAS+BLAS 架构\\nRT Core 硬件加速]&#10;    C --&gt; |大规模碰撞检测\\n粒子/流体| E[Compute Shader BVH\\n并行宽相]&#10;    C --&gt; |静态场景大量光线| F[GPU LBVH\\nMorton Code 并行构建]\">graph TD\n    A{是否有 GPU 加速需求?} --&gt; |否| B[CPU BVH\\n成熟稳定\\nPhysX/Jolt]\n    A --&gt; |是| C{场景类型}\n    C --&gt; |实时光线追踪\\n全局光照\\n反射| D[DXR/Vulkan RT\\nTLAS+BLAS 架构\\nRT Core 硬件加速]\n    C --&gt; |大规模碰撞检测\\n粒子/流体| E[Compute Shader BVH\\n并行宽相]\n    C --&gt; |静态场景大量光线| F[GPU LBVH\\nMorton Code 并行构建]</pre><p>GPU 空间加速结构代表了本 hub 所有技术的最终形态：将经典的 BVH、Morton Code 排序、范围查询等 CPU 算法映射到 GPU 的大规模并行架构上。这些技术在前面章节的基础上，参见 <a href=\"../bounding-volumes/bvh-construction\">BVH 构建与遍历</a> 与 <a href=\"../bounding-volumes/dynamic-bvh-updates\">动态 BVH 更新策略</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>GPU 空间加速结构将 CPU 端毫秒级操作压缩到微秒级：LBVH（Morton Code + GPU Radix Sort）3ms 内构建 1M 三角形的 BVH，比 CPU SAH 快 100x；RT Core 硬件 BVH 遍历单元使实时光线追踪每帧吞吐量提升 5-10x；TLAS+BLAS 两级架构分离实例变换（每帧更新）与三角形拓扑（离线构建），多实例共享 BLAS 大幅节省内存。Compute Shader 宽相碰撞（无需 DXR）可处理 10 万刚体 ~2ms。工程选型：实时光追用 DXR/Vulkan RT + RT Core；大规模碰撞/粒子用 Compute Shader BVH；静态场景批量光线用 GPU LBVH。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GPU 空间加速结构：并行硬件重塑碰撞与光线追踪","id":"gpu-空间加速结构-并行硬件重塑碰撞与光线追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GPU 并行 BVH 构建","id":"gpu-并行-bvh-构建"},{"level":3,"text":"LBVH：线性 BVH（Morton Code 方案）","id":"lbvh-线性-bvh-morton-code-方案"},{"level":4,"text":"步骤 1：计算 Morton Code","id":"步骤-1-计算-morton-code"},{"level":4,"text":"步骤 2：GPU Radix Sort","id":"步骤-2-gpu-radix-sort"},{"level":4,"text":"步骤 3：并行建树（Karras 2012）","id":"步骤-3-并行建树-karras-2012"},{"level":3,"text":"GPU BVH 构建性能","id":"gpu-bvh-构建性能"},{"level":2,"text":"RT Core：专用硬件 BVH 遍历单元","id":"rt-core-专用硬件-bvh-遍历单元"},{"level":3,"text":"DirectX 12 DXR API 使用","id":"directx-12-dxr-api-使用"},{"level":2,"text":"两级 BVH 架构（TLAS + BLAS）","id":"两级-bvh-架构-tlas-blas"},{"level":2,"text":"GPU Compute Shader 空间查询","id":"gpu-compute-shader-空间查询"},{"level":3,"text":"GPU 宽相碰撞检测","id":"gpu-宽相碰撞检测"},{"level":3,"text":"GPU 栈遍历的挑战","id":"gpu-栈遍历的挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"性能对比：CPU vs GPU 空间查询","id":"性能对比-cpu-vs-gpu-空间查询"},{"level":2,"text":"适用场景决策","id":"适用场景决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"R-Tree 与 KD-Tree：大规模静态空间数据的专用索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/advanced-techniques/r-tree-kd-tree"},"next":null}